S.8  WHERE NOTHING STANDS
     Tseitin formulas over 3-regular graphs: unsatisfiable, width 3,
     maximally shared supports, and the family on which resolution is
     provably exponential.  No stratum bars every boundary, so the
     composed boundary is empty -- returned, not searched for.

