S.10  THE PROTOCOL CAN FAIL

    PASS  freeing a content of a lighthouse admits addresses that do not stand, so no radius here is slack   [110 non-standing addresses appear]
    PASS  dropping a boundary that the assertion needs changes the answer   [15 of 43 boundaries are load-bearing; the remainder are carried by the others]
    PASS  inverting one boundary's terminus changes the answer   [15 against 8]
    PASS  the committed solution sets are not empty, so the readings are not vacuous
    PASS  an instance admitting nothing composes to the empty family   [0 lighthouses]
    PASS  composition.py imports nothing, so the composition cannot reach an address through another module   [0 imports]
    PASS  no function of the composition names an address or anything that forms one   [none of ['produce', 'read_region', 'region_str', 'stands', 'truth_set'] appears in any of them]
    PASS  no function of the composition forms the envelope 2^n   [the envelope appears in no composition function]
    PASS  the module carries no operation that decomposes a stratum into parts and none that enriches the assertion   [no addition of contents, per the Remark to Theorem 11.1; no mid-descent change to what was asserted at genesis]
    PASS  the composition reports no traversal tally   [no step of the descent is counted]

